WEBVTT

00:02.727 --> 00:06.247
We were expecting you, Ray!

00:07.347 --> 00:08.737
Finally.

00:08.977 --> 00:13.377
I'm sorry, but I have 
to defeat you two here.

00:23.407 --> 00:25.637
Full power from the start.

00:25.637 --> 00:27.967
Yeah, gonna use all I got here.

00:27.967 --> 00:30.237
Against you, I won't rely 
on fancy strategies!

00:33.827 --> 00:35.027
Get him!

00:41.517 --> 00:42.757
Not bad.

00:42.757 --> 00:44.147
But that's not good enough to...

00:46.307 --> 00:48.287
It can't be...

00:52.997 --> 00:55.147
Aurum Reverse!

00:55.677 --> 00:57.997
Ariane, let's go all in.

00:57.997 --> 00:59.337
You already want to use it?

00:59.787 --> 01:02.797
Look at that overwhelming materia field.

01:03.047 --> 01:05.727
He's not someone against whom 
we can worry about how we look.

01:05.727 --> 01:07.137
Understood.

01:10.237 --> 01:11.117
Ogre!

01:14.997 --> 01:16.507
Nice moves.

01:16.507 --> 01:18.427
Sufficient power as well.

01:18.787 --> 01:20.467
But you can't reach me.

01:25.357 --> 01:26.687
Amelia!

01:27.477 --> 01:29.337
Butterfly Effect!

01:31.347 --> 01:34.947
Eighth secret blade technique, 
Afterglow Blackout.

01:43.247 --> 01:44.787
I wasn't expecting that.

01:44.787 --> 01:47.557
In terms of just your code assembly skill,

01:47.557 --> 01:49.917
you'd be up there with 
the Seven Grand Sorcerers.

01:50.817 --> 01:52.077
Give it up.

01:52.077 --> 01:55.247
This world's causality has 
already been established.

02:00.977 --> 02:02.567
A perfect defense,

02:02.567 --> 02:05.397
not grounded in physical reality, but in 
controlling the principles of causality?!

02:05.397 --> 02:06.507
Looks like it.

02:06.507 --> 02:08.727
Amelia's Butterfly Effect has

02:08.727 --> 02:12.667
already created a result in which 
Lucas's attack "does not land."

02:13.237 --> 02:14.507
Hey, Carla.

02:14.507 --> 02:17.587
Did Dumbpink eat something bad?

02:17.587 --> 02:18.607
Who knows?

02:18.607 --> 02:21.487
Your original spell... is a nuisance.

02:23.677 --> 02:26.747
Then let's see which 
of us can last longer.

02:33.437 --> 02:34.337
I see.

02:34.337 --> 02:35.797
Time's up...

02:36.337 --> 02:39.267
The Butterfly Effect's weak point is...

02:39.267 --> 02:40.967
the duration it can be active.

02:44.707 --> 02:49.337
Ariane, I promise I will not 
let any attack hit you!

02:49.337 --> 02:51.627
So fight to your heart's content!

02:51.627 --> 02:53.407
Yes, that was the plan!

02:54.517 --> 02:57.787
Looks like it's a fight against 
time for both parties.

02:57.787 --> 03:04.337
Either Ariane Algren defeats Lucas Forst 
before the Butterfly Effect wears off...

03:05.847 --> 03:08.847
Or she exhausts herself before Lucas does.

03:08.847 --> 03:12.387
Hey, don't take my commentary!

03:12.387 --> 03:13.777
Quiet, Dumbpink.

03:13.777 --> 03:16.607
But it's time for Carocaro to shine!

03:15.747 --> 03:19.147
<i>How exactly do these people fit together?</i>

03:16.607 --> 03:18.357
Don't be like that, Caro.

03:47.087 --> 03:49.297
Oh, so those are the famous 
"lucky underpants."

03:49.297 --> 03:50.247
You know about those, Fran?

03:50.247 --> 03:50.837
Yes.

03:50.837 --> 03:57.597
<b>Butt</b>

03:50.837 --> 03:57.597
<b>Mochi</b>

03:50.837 --> 03:57.597
<b>Theory</b>

03:50.837 --> 03:52.837
Since time immemorial, 
it's a man's best outfit.

03:52.837 --> 03:56.037
With his creed carved onto his 
buttocks, he shows determination!

03:56.037 --> 03:59.337
People of Arnold, look at 
the Prattfall Theorem.

04:02.477 --> 04:06.897
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

04:07.187 --> 04:10.977
<b>Episode 4
The Boy Who Is the World’s Strongest Sorcerer
and His Friends Converse With Their Fists</b>

04:15.037 --> 04:18.417
May I have this dance?!

04:18.417 --> 04:21.247
Unfortunately, I'm not 
interested in dancing.

04:21.617 --> 04:23.347
Aurum Reverse...

04:23.347 --> 04:24.247
That's right.

04:24.497 --> 04:26.257
While we're inside its area,

04:26.257 --> 04:29.117
none of us can use 
any meaningful magic.

04:29.117 --> 04:30.937
So that's what it does.

04:30.937 --> 04:32.497
What's going on there?

04:32.497 --> 04:35.157
Well, the prima materia becomes...

04:34.217 --> 04:36.867
The original spell seems to 
be a wide-area interference type

04:36.867 --> 04:39.817
that suppresses the 
activation of prima materia.

04:39.817 --> 04:41.897
Rebecca, you too?!

04:42.507 --> 04:44.407
You're so smart!

04:44.407 --> 04:45.507
Not at all.

04:45.887 --> 04:48.767
So this is what you had 
planned from the beginning.

04:48.767 --> 04:51.657
There's no way we can win 
if you can use magic.

04:51.657 --> 04:55.777
This is how we planned 
on taking our victory!

04:55.777 --> 04:57.997
Ray, let's converse!

04:57.997 --> 04:59.157
With our muscles!

04:59.487 --> 05:02.837
Sure. Bring it on!

05:05.347 --> 05:07.297
He stripped?!

05:09.977 --> 05:11.417
Why?!

05:22.897 --> 05:25.837
<i>This is him with no 
magical enhancements...</i>

05:26.257 --> 05:27.637
<i>He's so...</i>

05:27.637 --> 05:28.637
<i>far!</i>

05:30.507 --> 05:33.007
<i>My entire body hurts.</i>

05:33.007 --> 05:35.897
<i>The strain of the Aurum 
Reverse is intense, too.</i>

05:35.897 --> 05:38.267
<i>But for some reason...</i>

05:39.287 --> 05:40.817
I feel like laughing.

05:40.817 --> 05:42.147
Right, Albert?!

05:42.147 --> 05:44.407
Yeah. That's right!

05:45.397 --> 05:46.397
<i>Ray.</i>

05:46.677 --> 05:50.587
<i>Meeting you allowed me to change.</i>

05:50.587 --> 05:52.817
<i>It allowed me to move forward.</i>

05:52.817 --> 05:53.987
<i>Which is exactly why...</i>

05:54.657 --> 05:57.147
<i>...I want to win against you!</i>

06:05.847 --> 06:06.807
<i>Ray.</i>

06:06.807 --> 06:07.807
<i>Ray...</i>

06:07.977 --> 06:09.297
<i>Ray!</i>

06:18.567 --> 06:22.577
I'm counting on you, Albert.

06:25.317 --> 06:27.717
Of course, Evi.

06:30.097 --> 06:31.987
You seem like you're at your limit.

06:31.987 --> 06:34.777
Albert, you've become strong.

06:35.797 --> 06:37.527
Come at me with everything you've got.

06:38.067 --> 06:40.207
I'll take you head-on.

06:40.637 --> 06:41.957
Yeah...

06:41.957 --> 06:43.207
Here I come!

06:54.977 --> 06:56.287
I see.

06:56.287 --> 06:58.877
Since she's protecting you...

06:59.707 --> 07:02.977
she is completely defenseless right now.

07:02.977 --> 07:04.167
<i>That's right.</i>

07:04.167 --> 07:07.437
<i>Right now, I can only 
control one causality.</i>

07:09.347 --> 07:12.247
I will not let you go near her!

07:12.247 --> 07:15.277
<i>Right now, all of his 
attacks are nullified!</i>

07:15.277 --> 07:19.497
<i>What I must do is 
incapacitate Lucas Forst!</i>

07:21.887 --> 07:24.127
Sorcerer-like magic?

07:24.457 --> 07:25.757
Yes.

07:25.757 --> 07:30.147
Would something like Amelia 
does be difficult for me?

07:30.147 --> 07:31.307
Yeah.

07:31.597 --> 07:35.137
You are a sorcerer suited 
to inside code magic.

07:35.137 --> 07:37.537
That's something dictated 
by innate talent.

07:38.397 --> 07:42.867
But "sorcerer-like" 
is a very strange expression.

07:43.527 --> 07:48.427
Magic is magic, whether it's 
inside code or outside code.

07:48.427 --> 07:50.187
There is no difference.

07:52.977 --> 07:56.027
Besides, I like your magic.

07:56.847 --> 07:59.937
Your ability to handle inside 
code is magnificent.

07:59.937 --> 08:02.677
It's almost like a reflection 
of your honest personality.

08:03.017 --> 08:05.167
Y-You really think so?

08:05.367 --> 08:09.367
Mastering inside code will 
grant you overwhelming power.

08:09.747 --> 08:11.667
You should keep going like you have.

08:11.967 --> 08:13.727
Straight forward!

08:19.617 --> 08:24.307
<i>He's always calm and collected, 
and his face never betrays him either.</i>

08:24.727 --> 08:27.057
<i>But he's got a hot fire in his heart.</i>

08:27.417 --> 08:30.077
<i>Sometimes, he can be quite 
eccentric as well...</i>

08:31.857 --> 08:36.227
<i>I love how he looks when he's 
laughing with his whole heart.</i>

08:36.787 --> 08:39.077
<i>Oh, now I get it...</i>

08:44.187 --> 08:48.327
<i>I kept denying it to 
focus on the tournament.</i>

08:48.817 --> 08:52.827
<i>Because I felt like admitting 
it would make me waver.</i>

08:53.607 --> 08:55.847
<i>That it would weaken me.</i>

08:56.327 --> 08:57.697
<i>But actually!</i>

08:57.697 --> 09:01.357
<i>Now that I've admitted it, I keep 
feeling stronger and stronger!</i>

09:09.427 --> 09:10.977
Incredible!

09:14.487 --> 09:16.517
Forst has finally...

09:16.517 --> 09:17.747
...been knocked down!

09:19.057 --> 09:21.997
Ariane falls to her knees!

09:33.507 --> 09:37.257
That was close, but time's up now.

09:37.527 --> 09:39.337
What's this?

09:39.337 --> 09:44.487
Forst is back on his feet 
as if he's taken no damage!

09:44.487 --> 09:45.767
You must be kidding...

09:46.137 --> 09:48.467
Could he be invincible?

09:48.467 --> 09:50.397
No. Take a good look.

09:51.927 --> 09:54.127
Oh, that's in deep!

09:54.127 --> 09:55.407
He's putting up a brave front.

09:55.407 --> 09:56.147
That's right.

09:58.137 --> 09:59.597
You're still standing?

09:59.597 --> 10:01.027
Of course!

10:01.027 --> 10:02.537
We can still fight!

10:02.537 --> 10:04.167
Impressive.

10:04.397 --> 10:07.227
There's nothing stronger 
than a maiden in love!

10:07.227 --> 10:08.277
I see.

10:16.867 --> 10:19.407
And the victory goes to Team Algren!

10:19.407 --> 10:21.647
They are the champions of the Magicks War!

10:22.307 --> 10:23.347
Al...

10:23.347 --> 10:24.557
Evi...

10:26.317 --> 10:29.087
They did it! They did it!

10:29.087 --> 10:31.077
Everybody was so amazing!

10:31.077 --> 10:32.607
That's my Ray!

10:32.607 --> 10:34.207
Big Brother!

10:34.207 --> 10:36.347
Maria, join in with us!

10:36.347 --> 10:38.237
Big Brother!

10:38.237 --> 10:40.397
He's not my big brother, though...

10:40.397 --> 10:42.327
Big Brother!

10:44.467 --> 10:47.147
Ray. You're wonderful.

10:49.307 --> 10:51.257
Did you see that, Carla?

10:51.257 --> 10:52.837
I sure did.

10:52.837 --> 10:54.817
Ray is so cool!

10:56.477 --> 10:58.587
It was a good match.

10:58.587 --> 10:59.447
Indeed.

10:59.447 --> 11:02.987
It's been a while since 
I was this entertained.

11:02.987 --> 11:04.127
Ray!

11:04.127 --> 11:06.147
You're Arnold's number one!

11:05.607 --> 11:07.737
You did it, Ray.

11:07.737 --> 11:10.337
We... We won?

11:10.337 --> 11:12.737
Yeah! Ray did it for us!

11:12.967 --> 11:14.037
Ray...

11:14.037 --> 11:15.487
Ariane.

11:16.227 --> 11:19.117
Just now, you were thinking about 
wanting to see Ray, weren't you?

11:20.917 --> 11:22.817
You don't need to hide it.

11:22.817 --> 11:24.567
I've known it for a long time.

11:24.567 --> 11:26.127
For a long time?!

11:26.127 --> 11:30.877
So you're saying you've known how I 
feel even before I knew how I feel?!

11:30.877 --> 11:33.027
You are very easy to read.

11:33.637 --> 11:35.897
So are you!

11:38.427 --> 11:39.737
It's true.

11:39.737 --> 11:42.347
I do love Ray.

11:43.517 --> 11:44.947
Well then.

11:44.947 --> 11:47.397
I guess we're rivals in love.

11:47.687 --> 11:49.647
We are?

11:49.647 --> 11:50.397
Yes.

11:50.397 --> 11:53.657
We've fallen in love 
with the same person.

11:53.657 --> 11:56.387
Amelia, you...

11:56.387 --> 11:59.237
You've also felt Ray's touch, right?

11:59.237 --> 12:00.667
On your heart.

12:01.577 --> 12:03.147
That's right.

12:03.147 --> 12:07.907
From now on, I'll be competing 
with you as your rival in love.

12:07.907 --> 12:08.907
Yeah.

12:14.947 --> 12:17.417
Oh, so funny.

12:15.897 --> 12:17.417
Kinokokon.

12:17.667 --> 12:19.787
Oh, and Rebecca, too.

12:19.787 --> 12:21.187
Oh, right...

12:23.797 --> 12:25.187
That looks like...

12:25.587 --> 12:26.887
I understand.

12:27.317 --> 12:29.687
You really were a great team.

12:29.687 --> 12:32.747
I was giving it everything 
I had until the end,

12:32.747 --> 12:35.697
but it looks like your side 
was just one cut above.

12:35.697 --> 12:37.047
You're too kind.

12:37.047 --> 12:40.577
You also had a seriously 
formidable and amazing team.

12:40.577 --> 12:42.037
Thank you.

12:42.037 --> 12:46.957
But I really want to go up 
against you, one on one.

12:47.287 --> 12:50.897
I'm looking forward to next 
year's Magic Chevalier.

12:50.897 --> 12:53.497
Yes. I am too!

12:59.997 --> 13:01.467
Need a hand?

13:01.877 --> 13:03.637
I'm fine.

13:05.647 --> 13:07.987
I'm sorry. We lost.

13:07.987 --> 13:10.477
Ray was still so much better than us...

13:10.477 --> 13:13.567
No, you two did great.

13:14.337 --> 13:18.487
And fighting on a team was 
a good experience for me.

13:18.757 --> 13:21.907
Having companions is not a bad thing.

13:24.747 --> 13:26.727
Amelia! Ariane!

13:26.727 --> 13:27.757
Ray!

13:29.317 --> 13:31.557
Where are your clothes?!

13:31.557 --> 13:32.687
There's a reason.

13:32.687 --> 13:33.997
Anyway, we did it!

13:33.997 --> 13:35.997
We won all because of you two!

13:35.997 --> 13:38.417
No, we all did this.

13:38.417 --> 13:42.147
Yeah, we all won the title... together.

13:42.147 --> 13:43.767
You're right.

13:43.767 --> 13:46.537
Anyway, put some clothes on!

13:46.537 --> 13:47.587
Peek.

13:49.267 --> 13:53.027
The Butterfly Effect, huh?

13:53.587 --> 13:55.747
So you're Amelia Rose.

13:57.287 --> 13:59.957
This is getting interesting.

14:02.757 --> 14:04.177
Your attention, please!

14:04.177 --> 14:09.107
Team Algren, the winners of the Magicks 
War, have just received their trophy.

14:10.567 --> 14:11.917
The fiercest battles are over,

14:11.917 --> 14:15.917
so please give all of our contestants 
here today a huge round of applause!

14:15.917 --> 14:18.537
Congratulations, Team Algren.

14:19.367 --> 14:21.927
Carocaro's feeling so emotional!

14:22.727 --> 14:24.657
Thank you so much.

14:24.657 --> 14:27.027
I wanted to stand next to Ray.

14:24.657 --> 14:26.547
You did great.

14:27.677 --> 14:30.707
Team Forst, your fight 
was also wonderful.

14:27.677 --> 14:30.707
This was actually a fun time.

14:32.237 --> 14:33.097
What?!

14:34.197 --> 14:37.367
You did great, Al!

14:36.517 --> 14:38.667
You were so cool, Evi!

14:39.297 --> 14:41.967
Congratulations, Amelia!

14:41.967 --> 14:43.097
So intense!

14:43.097 --> 14:45.207
This match was the best!

14:52.647 --> 14:53.947
Claris.

14:55.467 --> 14:56.717
Sorry.

14:56.717 --> 14:59.277
I'm going home now.

15:00.217 --> 15:04.097
I think I'll also take a break 
from school for a while.

15:05.997 --> 15:07.427
Wai...

15:07.857 --> 15:09.167
Elisa.

15:09.467 --> 15:11.937
Liese, that was so much fun!

15:09.467 --> 15:12.337
Hey, where's Dumbpink?

15:11.937 --> 15:13.607
It really was.

15:12.337 --> 15:13.437
Um...

15:13.237 --> 15:14.197
What?

15:13.607 --> 15:16.487
Sheesh Liese, you're 
always so restrained.

15:16.487 --> 15:18.117
You can celebrate too, you know.

15:16.817 --> 15:17.977
<i>No...</i>

15:18.117 --> 15:19.537
But I am.

15:18.637 --> 15:19.617
<i>Again?!</i>

15:19.537 --> 15:21.147
I even feel like doing a little dance.

15:19.617 --> 15:20.837
All right!

15:20.837 --> 15:23.377
This was another super fun event!

15:21.147 --> 15:21.747
Seriously?!

15:23.377 --> 15:27.487
Now, to wrap up the 
tournament, here's a song!

15:26.577 --> 15:28.667
Not yet!

15:28.667 --> 15:30.517
Come on, Abbie!

15:30.517 --> 15:32.997
This isn't the time to sing.

15:32.997 --> 15:34.297
That's not true!

15:34.297 --> 15:35.397
Everyone's waiting!

15:35.397 --> 15:37.717
Sorry. You can't sing yet.

15:39.497 --> 15:42.007
But why...

15:39.637 --> 15:42.007
Elisa, let's go.

15:42.857 --> 15:43.887
Yes...

15:53.727 --> 15:54.997
Peek.

15:56.137 --> 16:00.277
I'm sad that neither Master 
nor Abbie will make it.

16:00.277 --> 16:01.587
Right?

16:01.587 --> 16:05.117
Stinks that they got called away to 
a Eugenics counter-strategy meeting.

16:06.397 --> 16:09.627
Looks like there's been an 
uptick in their activity.

16:10.467 --> 16:11.537
Carol?

16:12.117 --> 16:13.047
Carol?

16:13.657 --> 16:14.847
What's wrong?

16:14.847 --> 16:17.027
It feels like you're not quite here.

16:17.027 --> 16:18.787
That's not true at all!

16:18.787 --> 16:21.457
I'm my regular ol' self!

16:24.097 --> 16:25.377
Really?

16:26.077 --> 16:27.617
The Hymn Festival?

16:28.037 --> 16:29.067
Yeah!

16:29.067 --> 16:31.547
Nothing says winter break 
like the Hymn Festival.

16:31.547 --> 16:32.997
That's true.

16:32.997 --> 16:35.367
I heard it originated from an event

16:35.367 --> 16:38.407
where hymns were sung 
in Arnold Kingdom's churches.

16:38.407 --> 16:40.557
Well, did you know this?

16:40.557 --> 16:42.707
Lately, it's become a thing for people

16:42.707 --> 16:46.077
to spend the Hymn Festival with their 
lovers rather than with their families.

16:47.157 --> 16:49.147
So anyway...

16:49.147 --> 16:51.227
As a member of one of the 
top three noble houses,

16:51.227 --> 16:54.727
I've been invited to a party 
hosted by the Magic Association.

16:54.727 --> 16:55.617
Would you care to...

16:55.617 --> 16:57.007
What a coincidence.

16:57.007 --> 16:57.827
Huh?

16:57.827 --> 16:59.997
I've been invited too.

16:59.997 --> 17:02.397
As one of the Seven Grand Sorcerers.

17:02.397 --> 17:04.007
Oh, of course.

17:04.007 --> 17:06.477
It's a good opportunity, 
so I thought I should go.

17:06.477 --> 17:09.747
Of course, Master, Abbie, 
and Carol will be with me too.

17:09.747 --> 17:11.217
Right...

17:13.517 --> 17:15.977
Of course, I am invited too!

17:15.977 --> 17:17.617
Rebecca?!

17:19.887 --> 17:21.757
We got invited too!

17:21.757 --> 17:24.427
For taking second place 
in the Magicks War!

17:24.427 --> 17:25.107
What?!

17:25.107 --> 17:27.917
Naturally, I'll be going too.

17:28.547 --> 17:29.897
Ariane?

17:30.737 --> 17:32.797
Why are you here too?

17:32.797 --> 17:34.237
Because I am!

17:34.607 --> 17:37.437
Seems like it's going to be 
quite the lively Hymn Festival.

17:34.607 --> 17:35.967
Can't wait!

17:35.967 --> 17:37.617
Right! It'll be fun!

17:37.437 --> 17:38.807
I guess...

17:38.117 --> 17:39.417
Very much so.

17:40.497 --> 17:43.597
Why are we going to Alphelia 
for this year's Hymn Festival?

17:43.597 --> 17:46.497
I wonder.

17:46.767 --> 17:50.727
A kingdom wrapped in mystery, 
where only elves live.

17:50.727 --> 17:53.067
They got a new king only six months ago,

17:53.067 --> 17:55.527
so all kinds of rumors are flying around.

17:55.527 --> 17:58.767
I wouldn't have thought we could 
even get in the country.

17:59.617 --> 18:01.517
<i>Something is definitely off.</i>

18:01.897 --> 18:06.377
<i>Carol would never be
this well-behaved on a fun trip.</i>

18:06.377 --> 18:08.017
Ray, what's wrong?

18:08.017 --> 18:09.717
Nothing.

18:10.117 --> 18:11.787
<i>Hold up.</i>

18:12.097 --> 18:15.207
<i>Is Ray still looking in my direction?</i>

18:15.797 --> 18:16.897
<i>Hot!</i>

18:16.897 --> 18:18.077
<i>His gaze is burning hot!</i>

18:18.077 --> 18:19.777
<i>And we're all alone?</i>

18:19.777 --> 18:23.117
<i>I mean, he's basically an adult now, 
and he gets more dapper every year.</i>

18:23.117 --> 18:26.017
<i>And honestly, if I wasn't half-joking, 
hugging him and stuff would be impossible!</i>

18:26.017 --> 18:27.627
<i>Impossible, impossible, impossible!</i>

18:27.627 --> 18:30.097
<i>Can I make sure he actually has fun?</i>

18:30.097 --> 18:32.897
<i>I mean, he was probably looking forward 
to going on this trip with everyone!</i>

18:32.897 --> 18:34.567
<i>I mean, I'm pretty sure 
he doesn't dislike me,</i>

18:33.207 --> 18:35.557
Carol? Carol?

18:34.567 --> 18:35.557
<i>but he always comes off as harsh...</i>

18:37.857 --> 18:40.807
If you're feeling sick, we should 
ask them to stop the carriage.

18:43.087 --> 18:44.187
Never been better!

18:44.447 --> 18:46.277
I'm in tip-top shape!

18:46.277 --> 18:47.727
Is that so?

18:48.657 --> 18:54.187
<i>Anyway, I'm going to take the lead 
on this trip as an older woman.</i>

19:02.417 --> 19:05.267
It'll take about another half 
day to get to Alphelia.

19:05.267 --> 19:08.197
We'll call it a day and 
have a nice rest here.

19:10.267 --> 19:11.717
What a nice room.

19:13.707 --> 19:15.717
A lovely view, too.

19:16.557 --> 19:20.677
<i>But I wasn't expecting to share a room...</i>

19:22.817 --> 19:27.817
<i>I can't believe a booking 
mistake led to this!</i>

19:28.227 --> 19:29.677
That was delicious.

19:29.677 --> 19:30.667
Yes.

19:31.467 --> 19:34.237
<i>Ray's really grown up.</i>

19:34.547 --> 19:37.207
<i>He was so adorable back then.</i>

19:37.747 --> 19:41.217
<i>And now, look at how cool he is.</i>

19:41.727 --> 19:43.737
Guess we'll go back to our 
room and take a bath?

19:46.847 --> 19:49.507
Carol, what are you thinking?

19:50.607 --> 19:52.857
Y-You should use the bath first.

19:52.857 --> 19:54.807
You should get in first.

19:55.297 --> 19:57.347
I take so long!

19:57.347 --> 19:58.527
And then...

19:58.527 --> 20:00.437
I'll take your finished plates.

20:00.437 --> 20:01.387
Ah, sure.

20:03.687 --> 20:04.887
Carol?

20:04.887 --> 20:06.447
Excuse me.

20:06.447 --> 20:07.867
Thank you.

20:08.497 --> 20:11.537
Getting in first is embarrassing!

20:11.537 --> 20:13.787
Like you... getting in the 
water that I was in...

20:13.787 --> 20:15.407
Would you like some water?

20:15.407 --> 20:16.747
We're fine!

20:19.537 --> 20:21.907
You getting in would mean...

20:24.897 --> 20:26.697
I'm sorry for being inconsiderate.

20:27.107 --> 20:28.717
I'll get in the bath first.

20:29.407 --> 20:32.697
Yes... Thank you.

20:52.817 --> 20:54.937
<i>Did she really fall asleep?</i>

20:56.127 --> 20:59.277
Hey Ray. About Elisa...

20:59.277 --> 21:00.357
Ever since that day,

21:00.357 --> 21:02.697
she's been taking time off school 
due to an issue at home.

21:02.697 --> 21:06.657
Lately, she's seemed really 
preoccupied by something.

21:06.657 --> 21:08.217
I'm a bit worried about her...

21:08.217 --> 21:10.317
You're right.

21:10.317 --> 21:13.207
Elisa was picked up by an elf, right?

21:13.207 --> 21:16.147
Yeah. I'm quite sure.

21:31.397 --> 21:34.547
Assist Ray White's awakening.

21:34.547 --> 21:36.447
That's what the higher-ups want, anyway.

21:37.297 --> 21:39.137
But my real goal is...

21:39.137 --> 21:40.177
this...

21:42.497 --> 21:43.477
What?!

21:43.477 --> 21:44.747
Oh, a face mask.

21:48.327 --> 21:50.177
Damn it.

21:50.177 --> 21:52.447
My motivation went past 
zero and into the negative.

21:52.817 --> 21:55.747
But... I guess the consecrated 
ground takes priority for now.

21:56.097 --> 21:58.067
How's are things going?

21:58.067 --> 22:00.347
Everything's going smoothly.

22:00.347 --> 22:01.007
'Kay.

22:09.547 --> 22:11.877
Wow, it's so pretty!

22:11.877 --> 22:13.507
So this is Alphelia.

22:13.507 --> 22:15.787
I still can't believe it!

22:15.787 --> 22:19.767
Looks like the accession of the new 
king brought about a lot of changes.

22:21.037 --> 22:22.787
Thank you, Ray.

22:23.267 --> 22:25.467
Welcome to our country.

22:26.187 --> 22:29.527
We've been waiting for you, Ray White.

22:30.067 --> 22:35.867
My name is Mia, and I will be 
your guide to the mansion.

22:35.867 --> 22:39.297
I was commanded to come here post-haste.

22:41.667 --> 22:44.047
They are this way.

22:46.877 --> 22:48.567
I have brought them.

22:57.067 --> 22:57.897
Elisa?!

22:57.897 --> 22:58.677
What?

23:00.227 --> 23:01.617
Ray...

23:48.827 --> 23:53.877
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.827 --> 23:53.877
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.827 --> 23:50.487
Can you hear me? 
It's time for the preview!

23:50.487 --> 23:51.287
I'm Elisa.

23:51.287 --> 23:52.177
I'm Mia.

23:52.177 --> 23:53.867
I'm your heroine, Carocaro!

23:53.867 --> 23:55.577
Hey, you two, what is going on here?

23:55.577 --> 23:56.447
No comments for now.

23:56.447 --> 23:57.247
Moving on!

23:57.247 --> 23:58.807
Very good, Elisa!

23:58.807 --> 24:00.627
That outfit is ultra cute!

23:59.677 --> 24:00.627
Ba-dump!

24:00.627 --> 24:01.577
Your heartbeat's loud!

24:01.577 --> 24:02.667
Oh yeah!

24:02.667 --> 24:03.287
Next time on...

24:03.287 --> 24:05.377
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World</i>!

24:05.377 --> 24:06.397
<i>Two</i>!

24:05.387 --> 24:09.177
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

24:07.117 --> 24:09.177
Love you tender, episode 5.

24:09.177 --> 24:15.087
<b>Episode 5
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest Sorcerer
Goes on a Date With That Girl in a Foreign Land</b>

24:09.397 --> 24:11.707
"The Boy Who Is the World's 
Strongest Sorcerer...

24:11.707 --> 24:13.607
Goes on a Date With That 
Girl In a Foreign Land?!"
